<title>USA: Sullivan Dental names Sullivan president.</title>
<headline>Sullivan Dental names Sullivan president.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ALLIS, Wis. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sullivan Dental Products Inc said on Thursday that Chief Financial Officer Timothy Sullivan will become president effective January 1.</p>
<p>Sullivan will retain his CFO title.</p>
<p>It said Robert Doering, who currently serves as president and chief executive officer, will remain CEO.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
